{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-05T06:24:03Z","content":"Now let me build all the core library files and pages. I'll use a subagent to write the files in parallel while npm installs:","tool_calls":[{"name":"define_subagent","args":{"description":"A subagent that creates multiple source code files for a Next.js project","enable_write_tools":true,"name":"file-writer","system_prompt":"You are a file-writing agent. Your job is to create source code files exactly as instructed. Write each file completely without truncation. Use write_to_file for each file. Always set Overwrite to true. Do not ask questions - just write all the files.","toolAction":"Defining file writer subagent","toolSummary":"File writer subagent"}}]}
